urcesSubtitle:"Agentic research of this chat",sourceUnit:"sources",searchPerformed:"Search performed",searchScope:"Web + tafsir library",viewAllResults:"View all results",greetingHello:"Hello! How can I help you?",askOrPickSuggestion:"Write your question or tap one of the suggestions below",viewAction2:"View",clarifyHurryHint:"If you are in a hurry, press “Start processing” now; the default options are set to automatic detection.",multiSelectAllowed:"(multiple choices allowed)",startProcessing2:"Start processing",resetAction2:"Reset",guestChatPrompt:"Smart chat is available to signed-in users only. Sign in or register to chat and keep your conversation history.",laterAction:"Later",shareEnableHint:"With this option on, anyone holding the link can read this whole conversation without signing in.",shareDisableHint:"Turning this option off disables the current link immediately.",shareSafetyHint:"System messages, uploaded files and account details are never shown on the public page.",viewInText2:"View in text",continueChat2:"Continue the chat",wizardExportContents:"The topic, the questions, the coverage matrix, the searches and every approved source in a single file.",showFull:"Show full",errorDetailsDev:"Error details (for developers)",retryAction2:"Try again",deviceOffline:"Your device is not connected to the internet.",checkConnectionHint:"Please check your internet connection and try again.",checkAgain:"Check again",noNodeDetail:"No further detail was recorded for this node.",noStepDetail:"No further detail was recorded for this step.",dadbanLandingIntro:"Dadban is an assistant for legal analysis and choosing an action path. It reads the issue, retrieves related articles from the national body of law, and maps likely routes with deadlines, competent forums, risk and cost — not a substitute for a lawyer, and not a guaranteed outcome.",hadithaOneBarHint:"Ask a question; the answer comes from Quranic verses and hadith.",hadithaKicker:"Quran and hadith",hadithaLead:"Haditha is a research and content assistant grounded in the Quran and Shia hadith — for topical study, pulpit work and intimacy with Ahl al-Bayt teachings, not for fatwas.",motaharKicker:"Collected works",motaharLead:"Research, explanation and content from Shahid Motahhari’s works; the master’s intellectual system, cited from the text, never from outside claims.",ahlebeytKicker:"Sira and teachings",ahlebeytLead:"Narrations, historical reports and topical notes for research, pulpit and content — without turning a report into a legal ruling.",mesbahLead:"Systematic study of philosophy, theology, ethics and social thought in Ayatollah Mesbah Yazdi’s works; the author’s view stays distinct from outside sources.",almizanLead:"Allameh Tabataba’i’s view in Tafsir al-Mizan, by Quran-to-Quran method — kept apart from hadith, philosophy or science quoted in the same commentary.",tasnimLead:"Research assistant for Ayatollah Javadi Amoli’s Tasnim: the verse in context, the author’s view distinct from quoted material.",parsaLead:"Short, clear, usable answers to everyday religious questions — without claiming marja‘ status or issuing a fatwa.",enterToSend2:"Enter to send",parsaProblemPara:"Everyday religious questions often sit scattered across several sources, and the answers are either too long or closer to a risalah than to lived language. Parsa is built for short, clear, usable answers to those questions: worship, ethics, family, common doubts and religious life.",parsaSolutionPara:"Ask in your own words. Parsa brings the nearest documented answers from trusted religious sources and offers guidance — without claiming marja‘ status, issuing a fatwa, or giving medical or legal diagnosis.",parsaBenefitPara:"For everyday ritual questions, doctrinal doubts, moral and family counsel, and the wisdom of rulings — not for a court file, specialist isnad work, or standing in for a marja‘.",parsaAiTitle:"Parsa AI",askParsaThis:"Ask Parsa this",chatWithParsa:"Chat with Parsa",parsaFooterAbou